#. type: Plain text
#: src/common/glossary.adoc:194
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "(((home))) A specific location in the machine's work envelope that is "
#| "used to make sure the computer and the actual machine both agree on the "
#| "tool position."
msgid ""
"A specific location in the machine's work envelope that is used to make sure "
"the computer and the actual machine both agree on the tool position."
