#. type: Plain text
#: src/common/glossary.adoc:325
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "(((Signed Integer))) A whole number that can have a positive or negative "
#| "sign.  In HAL it is usually a <<sub:hal-s32,s32>>, but could be also a "
