#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:109
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "'Max Step Rate' -(((Max Step Rate)))  StepConf automatically calculates "
#| "the Max Step Rate based on the driver characteristics entered and the "
