" root_window.tk.call (\"wm\", \"நெறிமுறை\", \".\", \"WM_DELETE_WINDOW\", \"அழிக்கவும்.\")\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the Text Font"
msgstr "உரை எழுத்துருவை மாற்றவும்"

#. type: delimited block -
