#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:2548
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "*Add a callback function that processes the general message*: +\n"
#| "Keep in mind this function will _get all general messages_ so the `dict` keynames are not guaranteed to be there.\n"
