"இல்லையெனில்."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/rtapi_byteorder.3.adoc:25 src/man/man3/rtapi_gfp.3.adoc:21
#: src/man/man3/rtapi_pci.3.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In kernel space, each rtapi_xxx or RTAPI_XXX identifier is mapped to the "
"underlying kernel functionality, if available."
