msgstr ""
"*rtapi_mutex_give* and *rtapi_mutex_try* சி-வைகாசி be used இருந்து non-"
"realtime, init/cleanup, and realtime code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/rtapi_mutex.3.adoc:38
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "*rtapi_mutex_get* may not be used from realtime code.\n"
