#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/hostmot2.9.adoc:449
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This pin will be set \"True\" if the module was still transferring data "
#| "when the value was read.  When this problem exists there will also be a "
#| "limited number of error messages printed to the UI.  This pin should be "
