#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/motion.9.adoc:40
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A comma-separated list of names for analog output pins.  This parameter "
#| "is mutually exclusive with *num_aio*, but can be combined with "
#| "*names_ain*. A maximum of *EMCMOT_MAX_AIO* names can be specified. The "
