#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:10
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "*loadrt sampler* **depth=**_depth1_[,_depth2_...] "
#| "**cfg=**_string1_[,_string2_...]\n"
