msgstr "*cfg*= _ string1 [, string2 ...] _"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/streamer.9.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Defines the set of HAL pins that *streamer* exports and later writes data "
"to.  One _string_ must be supplied for each FIFO, separated by commas.  "
"*streamer* exports one pin for each character in _string_.  Legal characters "
"are:"
