msgid ""
"If the circle is internal and a *small hole* then any lead-in will be "
"perpendicular and there will be no lead out."
msgstr ""
"வட்டம் உள் மற்றும் ஒரு * சிறிய துளை * என்றால், எந்த லீடினும் செங்குத்தாக இருக்கும், மேலும் "
"எந்த முன்னணி அவுட் இருக்காது."

#. type: NOTE
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2627
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If the circle is internal and not a *small hole* then any leadin and "
#| "leadout will be an arc.  If the leadin has a length greater than half the "
#| "radius then the leadin will revert to perpendicular and there will be no "
#| "leadout.  If the leadout has a length greater than half the radius then "
#| "there will be no leadout."
msgid ""
"If the circle is internal and not a *small hole* then any lead-in and let-"
