"a single set of quotes\\&. See the \"Description\" section for an "
"example\\&. If there are more messages than \"count\" or \"names\" then the "
"excess will be ignored\\&. If there are fewer messages than \"count\" or "
"\"names\" then an error will be raised and the component will not load\\&."
